{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-hillgate","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-hillgate-ellington-properties-dubai-silicon-oasis","about":"The Hillgate at Dubai Silicon Oasis by Ellington Properties is a collection of luxurious studio to 3-bedroom apartments and 3- and 4-bedroom duplexes moments away from Community Center Park. The project features two towers, Tower A and Tower B, which are seamlessly connected through a shared courtyard, providing a cohesive and inviting atmosphere. Tower A has16 floors above ground, complemented by two basement levels and a podium level. Meanwhile, Tower B offers a slightly shorter structure with 13 floors above ground, also including two basement levels and a podium floor. The central courtyard not only connects the two towers but also serves as a communal outdoor space. This architectural marvel stands tall in a nature-inspired setting, combining open spaces with stunning skyline views.Strategically located, The Hillgate by Ellington Properties offers residents easy access to Dubai’s premier destinations and business centers. With a range of shopping, dining, and wellness options nearby, residents experience unparalleled convenience. The community's blend of residential and business infrastructure creates an ideal environment for families and professionals. Embrace the chance to live in a thriving mixed-use community where a seamless lifestyle awaits.","price":1200000,"title":"The Hillgate","bitrix":{"id":1034,"pf_id":"are.2.14662","source":null,"project_id":"The Hillgate","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Hillgate","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ellington Properties","project_location":"Dubai Silicon Oasis"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_Hillgate_at_Dubai_Silicon_Oasis_by_Ellington_Properties_74483cd6ea.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312